        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1608 Rubber Door Silencer, 100 Pack</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis door cushioning rubber is for use on <b>Metal Door Frames</b>.  The dark gray rubber cushion push into a 3/16\" - 1/4\" diameter hole that is drilled in a metal door frame. Normally used on commercial, hospital and hospitality doors to silence the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wood-door-silencer-rubber-5-pack-don-jo-1609\"><b>Wood Door Cushion</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/adhesive-door-silencer-rubber-10-pack-don-jo-1610\"><b>Self Adhesive Cabinet Cushion</b></a>. \r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1608_size.gif?v=1704354548\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1608 Door Silencer\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt is recommended using 2 or more per door to prevent the door from warping.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1608 Door Silencer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Cushion Head Thickness: 3/32\" (.104)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Dark Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1608.pdf?v=1704262264\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1608 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as One Hundred Pack (100 each per bag). </b>\r\n</p>",
